
---
const title = "Privacy Policy";
const updated = "11 October 2026";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn how Biashivo Business Insights collects, uses, and protects personal information."
    />
    <title>{title} | Biashivo Business Insights</title>

    <style>
      :root {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #24364b;
        background: #f7fafc;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; }
      a { color: #008e74; }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, 92%);
        margin: auto;
      }

      header {
        background: #0c2033;
        padding: 24px 0;
      }

      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .brand {
        color: white;
        font-size: 23px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .brand span { color: #00c9a7; }

      .back-link {
        color: #d3e1e9;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .policy {
        width: min(850px, 92%);
        margin: 60px auto 80px;
        padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 60px);
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid #e2e9ef;
        border-radius: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #0c2033;
        font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 48px);
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }

      h2 {
        color: #0c2033;
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      p, li {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.85;
      }

      li { margin-bottom: 8px; }

      .updated {
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 35px;
      }

      footer {
        background: #071726;
        color: #cbd5df;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 30px 16px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .policy { margin: 25px auto 50px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand">BIASHI<span>VO</span></a>
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Homepage</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <article class="policy">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <p>
          Welcome to Biashivo Business Insights.
          We respect your privacy and are committed to handling
          personal information responsibly.
        </p>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how information may be
          collected, used, and managed when you visit our website
          or subscribe to Biashivo updates.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

        <p>
          When you voluntarily subscribe to our updates,
          we may collect:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Your name, if provided.</li>
          <li>Your email address.</li>
          <li>Your subscription preferences.</li>
          <li>
            Information related to subscription confirmation
            and email interactions.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Our website and service providers may also process
          technical information, such as browser details,
          IP addresses, and website usage data.
        </p>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>

        <p>
          We use the information collected for purposes such as:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Sending Biashivo early-access announcements.</li>
          <li>Sharing product development and launch updates.</li>
          <li>Providing practical business tips and resources.</li>
          <li>Responding to enquiries.</li>
          <li>Maintaining website and email security.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Email Subscriptions</h2>

        <p>
          We use MailerLite to manage email subscriptions
          and send updates.
        </p>

        <p>
          When you subscribe, your information may be processed
          by MailerLite to manage your subscription and
          deliver emails.
        </p>

        <p>
          Where enabled, you may be asked to confirm your
          subscription through a double opt-in email.
        </p>

        <p>
          You can unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time
          using the unsubscribe link included in our messages.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Sharing of Information</h2>

        <p>
          We do not sell subscriber personal information.
        </p>

        <p>
          We may share information with service providers
          necessary to operate our website, manage subscriptions,
          deliver communications, and maintain security.
        </p>

        <p>
          Information may also be disclosed when required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Cookies and Analytics</h2>

        <p>
          Our website or service providers may use cookies
          and similar technologies for essential functionality,
          security, or analytics.
        </p>

        <p>
          If we introduce additional analytics or advertising
          technologies, we will review this policy and provide
          any notices or choices required by applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Security</h2>

        <p>
          We take reasonable steps to protect personal information
          against unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.
          However, no internet-based system can guarantee
          complete security.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>

        <p>
          We retain personal information only for as long
          as reasonably necessary for the purposes described
          in this policy, including any applicable legal obligations.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may request deletion of your subscriber information
          by contacting us.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your Privacy Rights</h2>

        <p>
          Depending on applicable law, you may have rights
          to request access to, correction of, or deletion
          of your personal information.
        </p>

        <p>
          To make a privacy-related request, please contact
          us using the email address below.
        </p>

        <h2>9. International Data Processing</h2>

        <p>
          Biashivo Business Insights is intended for readers
          in Kenya and other countries.
          Our service providers may process information
          in locations outside your country of residence,
          subject to applicable legal requirements.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy as our website
          and services develop. Updates will be published
          on this page with a revised date.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy
          or how your information is handled, contact:
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Biashivo Business Insights</strong><br />
          Email:
          <a href="mailto:updates@bizhubke.online">
            updates@bizhubke.online
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Biashivo. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
